      "title": "YouTube star Ms Rachel to match Macklemore’s $1m Palestine aid donation",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2026/sep/17/ms-rachel-macklemore-palestine-donation",
      "description": "<p>Educator talks of ‘moral obligation’ and urges ‘every wealthy white celebrity’ to make similar donation</p><p>YouTube star <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/nov/22/meet-ms-rachel-the-youtube-goddess-worshipped-by-toddlers-and-parents-alike\">Ms Rachel</a> has said she <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DdZb_0PuS4y/?hl=en\">is matching rapper Macklemore’s $1m</a> donation to organizations supporting Palestinians, calling on other public figures to follow suit.</p><p>Macklemore, who was <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/sep/14/macklemore-dropped-ed-sheeran-tour-free-palestine\">fired</a> as the opening act on Ed Sheeran’s tour after saying “Free Palestine” on stage at New Jersey’s MetLife Stadium, pledged to donate the entirety of his earnings from Sheeran’s tour to several organizations focused on the Palestinian people.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/culture/2026/sep/17/ms-rachel-macklemore-palestine-donation\">Continue reading...</a>",
